# Patterns anchored to the repo root (unanchored "resources/" also matched
# apps/web/src/app/(portal)/resources and broke the Vercel build).
/docs/
/resources/
/*.jpeg
/*.pptx
/*.pdf
# Local build artifacts are regenerated remotely (bun install + prisma
# generate run in vercel.json's installCommand) — uploading them turned a
# 40 s deploy into a 6.4 GB upload that never finished.
**/node_modules
**/.next
**/.turbo
**/coverage
# Never upload local env files (secrets stay in Vercel project settings).
**/.env
**/.env.*
!/.env.example
!/.env.offline.example
